<title>USA: Senetek names Brune financial chief.</title>
<headline>Senetek names Brune financial chief.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Senetek Plc said Wednesday it named Clifford Brune as the company's chief financial officer, effective immediately.</p>
<p>Brune previously served as a business unit executive for the Computer Task Group Inc.</p>
<p>Brune replaces Paul Logan, who will remain as a director and corporate secretary for Senetek, Senetek said.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
